      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Saying \"lets enable creators to continue using unrecommended workflows instead of adhering to our set standard\" is probably more misguided. \n\nIf VRC decided to use WD Off, told everyone else that this is the standard, and then creators continued to ignore it, it's not VRC's fault that a creator's things end up broken by a user that is actually attempting to adhere to VRC's set standard.\n\nMaking things more complicated by using multiple workflows when you've already been informed to use a specific one so that such bugs can be ironed out, is probably more problematic for the end user than simply adhering to a set standard.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
