      "value": "@{5b07764455c49e65e1c52311|full_name} I'm not suggesting that WD Off be abandoned as the standard. I'm suggesting that this warning should be more finely targeted to the actual creators of avatars, rather than the end users who don't have much control over the process and are just trying to make their upload work. If I had to guess, there are a /lot/ more of the latter than the former.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
