        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think, good compromise would be \"Info\" icon instead of \"Warning\" icon. This way people who don't understand what it means will more likely ignore it.\n\nAs stated in https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/#write-defaults-on-states VRChat just recommends using WD off and it's fine to use WD on based on this part in the documentation: \"All that being said, if you get into more advanced use cases and setups, it may be advantageous to use Write Defaults On.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
